[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3169000887","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109440#issuecomment-3169000887","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109440","id":3169000887,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc684x23","user":{"login":"winston-yallow","id":44872771,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODcyNzcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44872771?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow","html_url":"https://github.com/winston-yallow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T18:50:12Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T18:50:12Z","body":"The behavior was introduced in b98da2bd58a7e467821ef392704f99ff8aabdd9b (via pull request https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87756)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3169000887/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3169070613","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109440#issuecomment-3169070613","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109440","id":3169070613,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc685C4V","user":{"login":"winston-yallow","id":44872771,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODcyNzcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44872771?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow","html_url":"https://github.com/winston-yallow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T19:22:08Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T19:40:43Z","body":"Alright this may be even worse than I initially thought as it can lead to changes without an entry in the undo/redo system:\n\n1. Have a scene with a mesh instance\n2. Open some other application so that you can see both Godot and the other application\n3. Hold down control/command while the other application is focused\n4. Now move the mouse over the object in Godot\n5. Drag the object outside of any Gizmo handles\n\n*[EDIT]* Even easier way to reproduce this:\n- set angle snap to 1° or similarly small\n- then do exactly as in the original issue description\n- no need for another application to steal focus, the snap distance is now smaller than the movement threshold for translation\n\nThe object will be rotated a tiny bit before Godot switches to translating it. The rotation will not appear in the undo/redo system!\n\nExplanation why this happens:\n- The rotation is started here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/80a219a58ad050519a8a51b76f7f43e15accc577/editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp#L2009-L2012\n- Then when the mouse is moved more than the threshold, we switch to translate. This happens without calling either `commit_transform()` or `cancel_transform()`, so it leaves the rotation applied without adding the change to the undo/redo stack:  https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/80a219a58ad050519a8a51b76f7f43e15accc577/editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp#L2180-L2184\n- With snapping the rotation will technically still happen, but you would need to move the mouse quite a bit to reach the next angle snap position. This however almost never happens, since the distance required is bigger than `movement_threshold_passed` so Godot will switch to translation mode before a snapped rotation can take place.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3169070613/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3169092231","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109440#issuecomment-3169092231","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109440","id":3169092231,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc685IKH","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T19:33:06Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T19:33:15Z","body":"CC @ryevdokimov @Calinou ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3169092231/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3171590670","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109440#issuecomment-3171590670","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109440","id":3171590670,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69CqIO","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-09T15:17:44Z","updated_at":"2025-08-09T15:17:44Z","body":"Fix submitted above.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3171590670/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]